},"widgets_values":["A simple image generator bot in Telegram. Uses Krea2 Turbo.\n\nFirst, create a new bot using @BotFather and get your bot's unique HTTP API token.\nTo run the bot, copy your bot's unique token into the purple text node above. Then change the queue mode from \"Run\" to \"Run (Instant)\" and queue the workflow.\n\nAs long as the workflow is running, anything you type to the bot in Telegram will be sent as text prompt to the image generator and the bot will respond to you with an image."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"A simple image generator bot in Telegram. Uses Krea2 Turbo.\n\nFirst, create a new bot using @BotFather and get your bot's unique HTTP API token.\nTo run the bot, copy your bot's unique token into the purple text node above. Then change the queue mode from \"Run\" to \"Run (Instant)\" and queue the workflow.\n\nAs long as the workflow is running, anything you type to the bot in Telegram will be sent as text prompt to the image generator and the bot will respond to you with an image."},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":11,"type":"TelegramAutonomous_Listener","pos":[-5252.375204232369,4445.4001770569985],"size":[400,300],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"bot_token","name":"bot_token","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"bot_token"},"link":15},{"localized_name":"timeout_time","name":"timeout_time","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"timeout_time"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"access_mode","name":"access_mode","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"access_mode"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"chat_ids","name":"chat_ids","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"chat_ids"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"message_text","name":"message_text","type":"STRING","links":[12]},{"localized_name":"chat_id","name":"chat_id","type":"INT","links":[13]},{"localized_name":"message_image","name":"message_image","type":"IMAGE","links":null},{"localized_name":"message_video","name":"message_video","type":"VHS_FILENAMES","links":null